{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/652-character-ideas","id":652,"title":"Character ideas.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-01T16:22:12-07:00","id":652,"title":"Character ideas.","content":"Oh dear god-machine first post in the demon forum TOO MUCH PRESSURE!<br /> <br /> Okay, so how about we talk about what you're going to make first in D:tD? I was thinking someone that Fell because she wanted to learn things that weren't part of her function, and she stumbled upon some horrible truth that made her unable to serve the God-Machine anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I had a signature but now I don't but it won't let me leave this blank so yeah.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/199-yue","name":"Yue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar199_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-01T19:26:56-07:00","id":795,"title":"","content":"I need to be able to read more of the book, but I have some ideas for a Fallen Age of Wrath, who couldn't kill &quot;X&quot; target. Pretty Cliche, yes, but until I've read more of the book, I won't have as much of a tableau of ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/238-hammerofheaven","name":"HammerofHeaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar238_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-01T19:27:13-07:00","id":797,"title":"","content":"The Demon I plan on making first is a Destroyer-Inquisitor but other than that I'm pretty blank. Reckon he fell 'cause he figured he knew who to destroy better, but that might be a little cliche.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-01T19:40:56-07:00","id":809,"title":"","content":"Though I don't know if it's even possible, I thought of a demon who was created to infiltrate a hunter cell posed as one of the other members. To accomplish this, he was implanted with one of the hunters memories after the hunter was &quot;removed&quot;. The memories proved too much to handle and he Fell, joining up with Hunters to fight the God-Machine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/89-quatren","name":"Quatren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-01T20:07:07-07:00","id":830,"title":"","content":"I have a demon who was originally meant to serve as the preacher that turned his church into a militaristic cult, but found religion first. The God-Machine is not the God of the Bible, Old or New Testaments. Why can't the real God stop it? ...He's still looking for that answer. Maybe he always will be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-01T20:50:24-07:00","id":874,"title":"","content":"I have two ideas, one being a Destroyer-Tempter who wants to be her very own Merovingian for the world under the God-Machine. She fell when she realized that she <i>wanted</i>, beyond what her programming decreed.<br /> <br /> The other idea I have is a Psychopomp Saboteur whose job was in mergers and acquisitions, helping to create corporations and organizations which would provide for the God-Machine's plans. He's a natural problem solver and delights in the creation of scenarios which help him acquire just what he needs. He Fell when he realized the most interesting logistical conundrum he could ever tackle would be the acquisition of and merging with the God-Machine... He's definitely the weird one, and I'm wondering if that's too abstract a collection job for a Psychopomp.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T01:28:23-07:00","id":994,"title":"","content":"A teacher trying to brainwash people to being psychologically incapable of breaking rules. It fell when someone pointed out that &quot;rules&quot; don't even exist, they're just words. Rather, it fell when thinking outside the box to find a counter argument.<br /> <br /> Bonus point: Where does this quote come from? <i>There are no rules</i>, <i>only principles</i> and <i>natural laws</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T21:01:46-07:00","id":1490,"title":"","content":"I've got a concept for a Messenger-Integrator who was tasked with giving a specific performance. At the last moment, he had a flash of hubris and wanted to perform his own song. He Fell and is miserable about it; he wants to rejoin the God-Machine (he sees being one with the Machine as being part of the greatest choir) but wishes to shape it from within to be a force of good. In the meantime, he makes do as a street musician. He hates himself for his moment of hubris and sees his current life on the run as punishment for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T00:08:57-07:00","id":1569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/652-character-ideas?p=1490#post1490\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've got a concept for a Messenger-Integrator who was tasked with giving a specific performance. At the last moment, he had a flash of hubris and wanted to perform his own song. He Fell and is miserable about it; he wants to rejoin the God-Machine (he sees being one with the Machine as being part of the greatest choir) but wishes to shape it from within to be a force of good. In the meantime, he makes do as a street musician. He hates himself for his moment of hubris and sees his current life on the run as punishment for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like that, though I think his hubristic nature should feed into his desire to integrate. Think, he sees the God-Machine as the greatest choir, but he has the greatest voice, and if they just let him back in...<br /> <br /> I feel like it'd be a nice, continuous reflection of the flaw. He might say things like &quot;I want to make it good!&quot; but really, he just wants to make it better by including himself. I don't think that's something he has to be too aware of, either. Ever told yourself a lie, where the back of your head is nagging about it but you ignore that little voice? Yeah.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T00:15:17-07:00","id":1573,"title":"","content":"What kind of names are people going with? My Messenger-Integrator is Joe, short for Jophiel, who was an angel that lead the heavenly choirs. I like Biblical names for angels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T01:58:12-08:00","id":1621,"title":"","content":"My character will be a Guardian similiar to the Street Kid.<br /> He was supposed to die during a mugging, so a mortal agent of the god-machine could fulfill his own task. However, the character killed the mugger in self-defense and fell, taking the name of a martyr: Sebastian.<br /> Deciding that life is too precious to waste it on tasks set by others or even die for some lofty goals, he became a Tempter, enjoying the luxuries of being superhuman, while living amongst the unwitting masses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/492-rerave","name":"ReRave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar492_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T02:55:56-08:00","id":1639,"title":"","content":"A Destroyer-Integrator who was supposed to kill a certain target who was supposed to be somewhere at a certain time. She showed up and waited, but the target never came. Fell basically because of a clerical error, and wants to make sure this kind of screw up never happens again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T07:06:15-08:00","id":1732,"title":"","content":"Since Covers are a separate thing, I don't think all of my Demons will take consistent special names. My Destroyer-Tempter for instance will be called Galatea, while my Psychopomp-Saboteur I'll probably call Rockefeller, though in the Unchained community he'll most likely go by shorthand nicknames like Rock or Rocky or Feller.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T07:24:51-08:00","id":1745,"title":"","content":"He was working toward a complicated purpose, posing as a physics teacher at university. He admired the vast work of the God-Machine, as much as a being without free will can admire anything.<br /> Yet, when another Angel in the building completed its mission and surrendered its existence to its creator, he fully realized his mortality. How dreadfully short his time was.<br /> One day would come when his conscience would disappear. And what was a great work worth, really, if there was no one to admire it?<br /> He henceforth botched his mission on purpose, so he would keep his existence and his free will. He's working to help other keep theirs. The God-Machine must have intentionally conspired to have these Angels fall, after all, there has to be a job only free-willed Demons can do. The works and plans of the God-Machine are so great, so encompassing, it can't have been a mistake. It can't possibly have made a mistake so dire and stupid. The Angels hunting him down must merely be slaves to their programming. They are the ones who are mistaken.<br /> Psychopomp?/Integrator.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T07:52:28-08:00","id":1761,"title":"","content":"A Psychopomp-Saboteur who distributed postage to agents of the God-Machine. When one of the most trusted agents killed himself rather than carry out an order, the Psychopomp realized that the choice to serve was, indeed, a choice. He Fell, and now distributes information to other Unchained, handing out missions to those who can act where he cannot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 11-04-2013, 06:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T10:22:21-08:00","id":2741,"title":"","content":"Well I've already posted it's demonic form in the topic related to Demonic forms so here is the idea of what I would create other than it's looks.<br /> <br /> Messenger/Integrator<br /> <br /> It did not have a name as an angel but it has chosen Wheel as it's name. The name that transcends it's covers which it never has much attachment too. As an angel it was tasked with the singular task of bringing down the the corporate structure of a fortune a local drug store. It noticed an opportunity to bring down the entire chain and recognition how it would benefit the Machine and recognized that doing this other thing would bring more power. In that moment of decided to topple the chain, It fell.<br /> <br /> Now somewhat angry (and in the cover of the head of the drug store chain) it finds itself with a feeling of a loss of power. It misses the connection to power it had as an angel but is angry at the machine for casting it down for being smart. An ever seeker of power, wheel looks for ways to rejoin the machine, after a few tweaks of coarse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T18:12:31-08:00","id":3906,"title":"","content":"SHODAN, obviously.<br /> <br /> Thank you, Demon House!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T16:08:27-08:00","id":6446,"title":"","content":"For the last hundred or so years, she was part of an experimental project in which she was assigned to be the handler of one of the Deathless. When the Machine wanted a powerful, reusable asset, IT would activate her, she would wake the mummy and keep him under control. she did this by masquerading as his wife, using his broken and fragmented memory to convince him she had ALWAYs been his wife, and that he served justice, not a machine. Once, she was even tasked to ending his descent when he went awol. He was kept in his stone tomb unused since then, until Sothis woke him. He went rogue once again, after his memories began collecting. Aware that the sothic rising would be difficult to manage, she was ordered to incapacitate him so that her supervisor could make the decision of putting him in a very sealed tomb for a very long time. Somehow, she hated the idea of her false husband being trapped forever. assigned as his handler, she hoped that the sothic cycle would let them live happily for years, so she might really feel like a wife. She refuses to kill him, and instead takes her own life so that her supervisors would not activate external override and force her. In choosing to die, she chose to be free. she fell--and the impact of her fall, and the subsequent birth of her Cover, made those lies she had told him for so long REAL. now, she IS his wife.. and now, they are both free of the Machine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T18:56:02-08:00","id":6540,"title":"","content":"Doesn't the G-M explicitly not reuse Angels?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T21:10:09-08:00","id":6595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/652-character-ideas?p=6540#post6540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Doesn't the G-M explicitly not reuse Angels?</div> </div> </div> </div> in some cases, no. But i recall reading in the fluff that it does sometimes just have the same angel go dormant until needed, especially if the infrastructure would be inefficient to obtain. In a specialized case like this, its probably the case, especially since she was fulfilling the same general mission. However, she does believe that she wouldve likely been deleted once the mummy was no longer an asset (ie her task to imprison him wouldve likely been her end if she went through with capturing him).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T10:47:27-08:00","id":6917,"title":"","content":"From what I've read, most don't get reused but some do (from the sounds of it, it's not uncommon.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T18:37:16-08:00","id":7128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/652-character-ideas?p=6917#post6917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From what I've read, most don't get reused but some do (from the sounds of it, it's not uncommon.)</div> </div> </div> </div> I imagine for the Machine, its about efficiency. It took a very long time (and many failed attempts) to whipe the mummy's memory clean enough to be taken advantage of. the &quot;wife&quot; had to get to know the mummy's personality and such well enough to be convincing, even when the mummy's broken memory highlighted different aspects and traits about her in each different lifetime. it would be difficult to copy all of the personality traits that he remembers onto a new copy of the wife. plus, itd be expensive. her infrastructure included all the existing details of his true wife--all of his journals, pictures of her, poetry. psychopomps gathered all of that, and it may have been destroyed in the process of this angel's genesis. its questionable if the Machine could find the right infrastructure to remake that angel--especially for every time the supervisors wanted to deploy the mummy. and the last thing they would want would be the mummy to think something is off or fishy, to go on a rampage because his knew wife was &quot;wrong&quot;. This all added up, in the machine's logistics, to meaning it would be more efficient to keep the same angel dormant, and simply turn it on and off when needed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-10T09:54:18-08:00","id":7413,"title":"","content":"A Guardian-Inquisitor (I've named her Red for the time being) tasked with protecting a fairly uninteresting man that she nonetheless came to care for somewhat. Another Angel swooped in and destroyed him. The shock of losing her target (and her confusion that the God-Machine would have contradictory orders) rattled her into Falling.<br /> <br /> A Destroyer-Tempter (I call him Nero) sent to kill one of the Unchained. His target accepted his fate, but told Nero what awaited him after he completed his mission; recycling. Fear of mortality caused him to Fall; now he's a violent asshole who wants to explore everything available to this new body of his.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T20:13:36-08:00","id":9431,"title":"","content":"Michael (Destroyer/Saboteur) was sent to kill a priest. The man did not resist his fate, but asked to minister to the Angel first. For whatever reason, it listened. Michael learned of a loving and forgiving God, nothing like the vile, inhuman thing he served. He Fell, and has adopted a Gnostic view of the world; the God-Machine is a usurper, a false image of the divine. It falls to him to convert its servants and destroy its works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T07:14:19-08:00","id":9659,"title":"","content":"A Guardian, assigned a Cover as the child of a rich couple who were unknowingly helping create some vital Infrastructure. Assigned insufficient resources to defend them - seriously, his cover was six years old - they were killed by a random mugger in the street.<br /> <br /> So, having failed to destroy the threat, he trained and self-modified, using his Cover's resources as their heir. At first, he was simply going to destroy the threat; a mission that had lost its purpose, but still following orders.<br /> <br /> But then, he began to see the mugger as simply one facet of a greater threat - if it hadn't been that one mugger, well, there are a lot of muggers out there. He resolved to clean up the streets.<br /> <br /> After all, criminals are a cowardly lot. So he would teach them to fear him. To fear the legend he would create ... of a monstrous bat-man that haunted the night, dealing out justice.<br /> <br /> (Batman! Inspired by the combination of the Bolt-Hole Merit (batcave!) and the fact that grappling hooks are a Propulsion.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/877-mugasofer","name":"MugaSofer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar877_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T10:07:08-08:00","id":12141,"title":"","content":"I just found the perfect name for my deterministic Psychopomp Integrator/Inquisitor, whose Cover is that of a physics professor.<br /> Mr. Laplace.<br /> I'm amazed and ashamed I didn't find it along with the concept.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T13:39:47-08:00","id":12276,"title":"","content":"Mr. Lead, whose primary (and, at start of game, only) cover is a burned-out office worker named John Triton, is a Destroyer-Tempter. He Fell because he got too deep into his cover; he was supposed to &quot;snap&quot; and massacre the entire office in a storm of bullets. Instead, he found himself gravitating toward other unhappy workers, and instead of killing the whole office, he stood up and organized a strike, demanding better working conditions. The murders were supposed to give the God-Machine's human agents a way to have the building emptied, condemned, and destroyed... and instead, the potentially dangerous bit of Infrastructure that the building houses continues to operate (dangerous to whom would, of course, be up to the ST). I've actually begun working on a character sheet for him; apart from needing the three &quot;unknown&quot; Keys of his Cipher, filling out his Demonic Form, and having to decide on his final two Embeds/Exploits, I've almost got Mr. Lead down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-18T04:09:31-08:00","id":13314,"title":"","content":"This is my first post on the new forums.<br /> <br /> I'd just started to read the D:tD kickstarter preview... and I'm liking it a lot!<br /> <br /> An idea that had ocurred to me was a &quot;Support Angel&quot;, charged to clean/erase/fix/adapt the mess another angels had done in their missions. Also an angel obssessed with perfection, responsible to secure that the good result of other angels could last for the intended amount of time fixed by the God-Machine.<br /> <br /> Maybe, after washing too much blood from another's hands, he'd found compassion, or a sense of purpose that just shouldn't be, and fell.<br /> <br /> I don't know about the right in-game definitions or sub-splats yet... Just need to finish the book... and I thinkg it'll be pretty soon <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/646-mabafu","name":"mabafu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar646_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}